---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PostCard from '../components/PostCard.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { getPosts, href, postHref, tagHref, readingTime } from '../lib/posts';
import { site } from '../config';
const posts = await getPosts();
const featured = posts.find(post => post.data.featured) ?? posts[0];
const tags = [...new Set(posts.flatMap(post => post.data.tags))];
---
<BaseLayout>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> A LITTLE CORNER OF THE INTERNET</div><h1>把好奇种下，<br/>让<span class="serif-accent">想法</span>生长。</h1><p>你好，我是 Neil。<br/>在这里记录技术探索、开发实践，和那些值得留下的思考。</p><a class="text-link" href={href('about/')}>关于这座数字花园 <Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></a></div>
    <div class="garden-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="art-orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="art-orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="art-sun"></div><div class="art-book book-back"></div><div class="art-book book-front"><span class="book-caption">FIELD NOTES<br/>ON CURIOSITY</span><svg viewBox="0 0 160 180" fill="none"><path d="M80 170V60M80 125C25 125 20 80 30 45c43 2 66 34 50 80ZM80 85C80 36 111 17 143 24c-1 45-25 68-63 61Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path d="m80 125-34-58m34 18 44-43" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"/></svg><span class="book-bottom">NEIL'S DIGITAL GARDEN</span></div><span class="art-label">Ideas take root here.</span><span class="art-star">✳</span></div>
  </section>
  <div class="home-grid">
    <div class="feed">
      {featured && <section class="featured"><div class="eyebrow"><span>✦</span> 从这里开始 · 精选文章</div><a href={postHref(featured)}><h2>{featured.data.title}</h2><p>{featured.data.description}</p><div class="featured-bottom"><span>{featured.data.tags[0]} <span class="meta-dot">·</span> {readingTime(featured.body)} 分钟阅读</span><span class="round-arrow"><Icon name="arrow" size={20}/></span></div></a></section>}
      <section id="writing" class="writing"><div class="section-title"><h2>最近写下的 <span>{String(posts.length).padStart(2, '0')}</span></h2><a href={href('archives/')}>全部文章 <Icon name="arrow" size={16}/></a></div><div class="topic-strip"><span>探索话题</span>{tags.slice(0, 4).map(tag => <a href={tagHref(tag)}>{tag}</a>)}</div>{posts.length ? posts.map(post => <PostCard post={post}/>) : <p class="empty-state">花园刚刚开垦，第一篇文章正在路上。</p>}</section>
    </div>
    <aside class="sidebar"><section class="profile-card"><div class="profile-top"><span class="avatar">N<span>✳</span></span><span class="small-note">HELLO, WORLD.</span></div><h2>我是 Neil <span>↗</span></h2><p>一个保持好奇的开发者。<br/>喜欢把想法变成小工具，<br/>也喜欢把过程写成文字。</p><a class="text-link" href={site.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><Icon name="github" size={17}/> GitHub <Icon name="arrow" size={15}/></a><div class="profile-stats"><div><strong>{posts.length}</strong><span>篇文章</span></div><div><strong>{tags.length}</strong><span>个话题</span></div><div><strong>∞</strong><span>份好奇</span></div></div></section><section class="aside-note"><span class="eyebrow">ABOUT THIS GARDEN</span><h3>不求完整，持续生长。</h3><p>这里的文章像花园里的植物：有些刚刚发芽，有些还在修剪。欢迎随时回来走走。</p><a href={href('rss.xml')} class="rss-link"><Icon name="rss" size={17}/> 通过 RSS 订阅 <Icon name="arrow" size={15}/></a></section><div class="sidebar-quote"><span>“</span><p>学到的东西，<br/>写下来才会生根。</p><small>A NOTE TO MYSELF</small></div></aside>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
